---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../../components/SectionHeading.astro";
import { team } from "../../data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Meet the team at Wren Hair Studio in Clapham and read the story behind our independent salon on Abbeville Road."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 pt-14 sm:pt-20 pb-14">
    <p class="eyebrow text-accent text-xs sm:text-sm mb-4">Our story</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black uppercase text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink">
      A small studio, run <span class="text-accent">properly</span>.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-soft leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
      Wren opened in 2017 in a narrow shopfront on Abbeville Road, with two
      chairs and a basin borrowed from a salon two doors down that had just
      closed. Marcus Adeyemi, our founder, wanted a studio where every
      appointment had proper time attached to it &mdash; no ten-minute
      consultations squeezed between three other clients.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="reveal mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 pb-16 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562322140-8baeececf3df?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&h=900&q=80"
      alt="Stylist blow-drying a client's hair at Wren Hair Studio"
      class="w-full h-80 sm:h-[420px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md"
      loading="lazy"
      width="1100"
      height="900"
    />
    <div class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>
        Nine years on, Wren is still the same two-chair footprint &mdash; we
        added a basin and a colour bar, but never expanded past what one
        small team can run well. Every stylist here mixes their own colour by
        eye, and consultations are never rushed: if you need twenty minutes
        to talk through a change before anyone touches your hair, you get
        twenty minutes.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're proudly independent. No franchise, no fixed price list handed
        down from head office &mdash; just three people who've chosen to work
        together, on one road, in Clapham.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reveal bg-ink text-canvas py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <p class="eyebrow text-accent-soft text-xs sm:text-sm mb-3">Meet the team</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl uppercase text-canvas tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
        Who's behind the chair
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {
          team.map((member) => (
            <div>
              <img
                src={member.image}
                alt={member.alt}
                loading="lazy"
                width="600"
                height="750"
                class="w-full h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl"
              />
              <div class="pt-5">
                <h3 class="font-display font-black text-lg uppercase tracked text-canvas">
                  {member.name}
                </h3>
                <p class="eyebrow text-accent-soft text-xs mt-1">{member.role}</p>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70 leading-relaxed">
                  {member.bio}
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reveal mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20">
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="How we work" title="Three things we won't compromise on" />
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-2xl border border-line shadow-md p-8">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-10 mb-6 block rounded-full bg-swatch-caramel" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracked text-ink">Real consultations</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
          Every first visit starts with a proper conversation about your
          hair's history, not just what you want it to look like tomorrow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-2xl border border-line shadow-md p-8">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-10 mb-6 block rounded-full bg-swatch-copper" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracked text-ink">Mixed-on-the-day colour</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
          No pre-set formulas. Every colour is mixed against your hair, in
          the room, on the day.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-2xl border border-line shadow-md p-8">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-10 mb-6 block rounded-full bg-swatch-espresso" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracked text-ink">One chair at a time</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
          Each stylist sees one client at a time. We'd rather run a shorter
          day than double-book a chair.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
